 // ---- heap section ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-// One pagefile-backed section (SEC_RESERVE, nothing is charged until committed) with a primary view at kHeapBase.
+// One pagefile-backed section (SEC_RESERVE, nothing is charged until committed) with a primary view at kHeapBase, or, with
+// [memory] heap_backing = private, a private reservation at kHeapBase: then heap_alias and heap_private_view are refused and
+// heap_decommit really frees the pages.
